# Agent workflow (Ruida)

## Default: no implementation

- In this project, **discussion / suggestions / answers do not authorize code or asset changes**.
- Do **not** edit source, configs, Content, Tools, or `.cursor/rules` unless a keyword below is present in the **current user message** (or that message clearly continues an already-keyword-started implement turn).
- Design talk, “建议”, “方案”, self-test results, “取消/改成/下次…” without the keyword → **advise only**, or confirm understanding; **no patches**.

## Keywords (exact)

| Keyword | Meaning |
|---------|---------|
| **开始实现** | Allowed to implement the task described in that message (and follow-ups that clearly continue the same implement request until done or user stops). |
| **开始无人开发模式** | Unattended / autonomous development mode for the scoped task — may plan and implement without waiting for per-step 开始实现 until the user ends the mode or the scoped task is done. |

- Without either keyword: **never start coding**, even if the request sounds like an order (“改掉”, “取消”, “加上”).
- If unclear whether a message is still under an open implement turn, **ask** instead of coding.

## Program ↔ resource AI sync (GitHub `docs-sync`)

**Single source on GitHub branch `docs-sync`** — Cursor（程序）与外部设计 AI（ChatGPT、Google AI Studio / Gemini / Nano Banana）读写同一套文件。

### Single Developer Mode

- Git 读 / 写：public
- Create / Modify / Add Assets：Allowed
- 不需要 PR、分支审批、额外人工 ACL
- 不删除已有规范；不覆盖 LOCKED；不擅自改已发布资产版本
- 明确的档案工作单（列出要创建/修改的 `Docs/specs` 路径）视为对该档案范围的实现许可
- 概念材质卡 `MAT-*` 权威在 `Docs/specs/assets/ships/material-cards/`；程序不要拿它改游戏 3D mesh 材质

### Authority

| Layer | Path |
|-------|------|
| 入口清单 | `spec-manifest.yaml` |
| 系统规范 | `Docs/specs/systems/ship-system/ship-system.md` |
| 程序运行时 | `Docs/specs/systems/ship-system/ship-program.md` |
| 本船设计 | `Docs/specs/assets/ships/ShipType_SmallSailer01/design.md` |
| 本船接口 | `Docs/specs/assets/ships/ShipType_SmallSailer01/integration.yaml` |
| 默认材质卡 | `Docs/specs/assets/ships/material-cards/MAT-001/` |
| Cursor 适配 | `.cursor/rules/ship-system.mdc`（不得另写一套事实） |
| ChatGPT 适配 | `Docs/tool-guides/chatgpt.md` |
| Google AI Studio 适配 | `Docs/tool-guides/google-ai-studio.md` |

`Docs/Ship/SmallSailer01.md` 与 `Docs/Ship/ShipAssetContract.md` 为 SUPERSEDED。  
On conflict: **canonical `Docs/specs` wins** over chat memory and tool adapters; do not silently change program interfaces from design docs alone.

### Who commits / pushes

- **Cursor agent** may `git add` / `commit` / `push` to `docs-sync` when Ruida asks or when a **contract/interface milestone** is done.
- ChatGPT / Google AI Studio 产出候选稿；Playground 通常不能 `git push`，由 Cursor 代提交。
- **Push requires GitHub auth on Ruida’s machine** (browser login or token). If push fails, Ruida runs `git push` once in terminal.
- **Large branch `dev/widepath-nav` is not used for design-AI sync** — only `docs-sync`.
- Do **not** use Google AI Studio **Build → Import GitHub** on this Unreal repo.

### Notification block (mandatory after interface changes)

After program or design changes **sockets, naming, Validate, catalog, or V0.x contract**, append a copy-paste block for the **other** AI:

**Program → Resource AI (ChatGPT / Gemini):**

```text
【程序侧同步 — 请读 GitHub docs-sync 最新】
仓库：wumary423-hub/Project01  分支：docs-sync
变更：<一句话，如 ship-system 观察距离或 MastRig 合同>
请你：<具体动作，如对照 design.md 更新概念图或候选稿>
权威：spec-manifest.yaml → Docs/specs/systems/ship-system/ → 本船 design.md / integration.yaml
```

**Resource AI → Program Cursor (Ruida 转发或设计侧改 docs-sync 后):**

```text
【资源/设计侧同步 — 请读 GitHub docs-sync 最新】
仓库：wumary423-hub/Project01  分支：docs-sync
变更：<Docs/specs/… 或概念图修订>
请你：<评估是否改 ship-program / integration.yaml / Validate；列冲突>
若无程序接口变更：只更新 design.md / ADR / changelog，不必动 C++。
```

Ruida may require **either side** to produce this block whenever Stage 结束 or 接口拍板.
